    "examples": {
        "example": [
            {
                "text": "they are free to \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E as they please",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.050"
            },
            {
                "text": "I never really got the chance to finish school or \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E my exams",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.038"
            },
            {
                "text": "I \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E want to act on this",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.075"
            },
            {
                "text": "the old version will \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E for now",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.055"
            },
            {
                "text": "what can I \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E for you?",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.015"
            },
            {
                "text": "this would be an easy place to \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E and there was plenty of money lying around",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.060"
            },
            {
                "text": "if he's anything like you, he'll \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.055"
            },
            {
                "text": "what a lot there is to \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E!",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.015"
            },
            {
                "text": "the barber said he'd \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E me next",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.033"
            },
            {
                "text": "\u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E tell me!",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.076"
            },
            {
                "text": "I never seem to say the right thing, \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E I?",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.070"
            },
            {
                "text": "\u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E you have any pets?",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.066"
            },
            {
                "text": "as the cops get smarter, so \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E the crooks",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.073"
            },
            {
                "text": "it takes them longer to \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E their hair than me",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.022"
            },
            {
                "text": "the walk will \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E me good",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.052"
            },
            {
                "text": "a couple of bucks'll \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E me",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.055"
            },
            {
                "text": "\u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E not forget",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.071"
            },
            {
                "text": "he decided to \u003Cb\u003Edo\u003C/b\u003E her a favor",
                "definition_id": "m_en_gbus0286760.024"
            }
